and we could have
 at least stopped by the kitchen 

00:24:38.017 --> 00:24:41.645
or even a damn vending machine on the way
 to the Undertaker's headquarters.

00:24:41.645 --> 00:24:44.940
As for getting to take our candy aside,
 Ganta should have also

00:24:44.940 --> 00:24:48.110
eaten before his next fight,
 as we already talked about this.

00:24:48.110 --> 00:24:49.695
Remember the golden rule? 

00:24:49.695 --> 00:24:53.282
The better the blood sugar
 we got, the better the butcher we are.

00:24:53.282 --> 00:24:54.992
You know what? I'm pissed at everyone. 

00:24:54.992 --> 00:24:58.328
Guys, we could have at least tried
 asking for cool guy to help us.

00:24:58.370 --> 00:24:59.538
Like I said earlier, where? 

00:24:59.538 --> 00:25:01.373
Even Yoh's batshit crazy sister 

00:25:01.373 --> 00:25:05.169
who he ran into right before we got into
 the Undertaker's headquarters,

00:25:05.169 --> 00:25:08.297
and speaking of which,
 this was the perfect opportunity

00:25:08.297 --> 00:25:12.176
for God to add his powers to grab weapons
 from the undertakers as they took

00:25:12.176 --> 00:25:12.968
some of them out. 

00:25:12.968 --> 00:25:16.805
And this way, we could have saved up
 some of our powers for the main bad guy,

00:25:16.847 --> 00:25:18.265
Rockstar himself. 

00:25:18.265 --> 00:25:22.102
And Ganta did everything right
 with Rockstar somehow pulling a finishing

00:25:22.102 --> 00:25:23.228
move out of nowhere. 

00:25:23.228 --> 00:25:27.107
But what I would have done is violently
 push Shiro into Rockstar, right?

00:25:27.107 --> 00:25:31.528
As I took out my Ganta gun, using her body
 as a shield of meat, so to speak,

00:25:31.528 --> 00:25:34.907
preventing Rockstar from getting me
 with his guitar gone before blasting

00:25:34.907 --> 00:25:38.410
both Shiro and Rockstar away, killing
 both of them in the process.

00:25:38.452 --> 00:25:40.829
Cold, heartless and totally unnecessary.

00:25:41.079 --> 00:25:42.206
I love it.

00:25:42.206 --> 00:25:44.583
With Rockstar dead
 white haired girl and Ganta

00:25:44.583 --> 00:25:47.961
gather around scarf
 as he gives Ganta his candy before dying.

00:25:47.961 --> 00:25:51.131
Shiro asks him if he plans to escape
 with white haired girl

00:25:51.131 --> 00:25:52.508
and the rest of the dead man. 

00:25:52.508 --> 00:25:56.261
But Ganta tells her that he can't leave her
 a friend behind.

00:25:56.303 --> 00:26:00.307
The rest of the Deadman escape as Ganta
 and Shiro sit on top of the prison

00:26:00.307 --> 00:26:05.020
building, looking out onto the skyline
 as Shiro sings a familiar song.

00:26:05.020 --> 00:26:09.233
Shocked, Ganta realizes that it's
 the same creepy melody that he first heard

00:26:09.233 --> 00:26:12.819
at school right before his classmates
 were brutally murdered.

00:26:12.861 --> 00:26:17.741
But he lets his suspicion slide, showing
 us just how whipped Ganta really is.

00:26:17.866 --> 00:26:20.744
And if you don't want to be wrapped around
 Shiro fingers like a tasty reinvolved,

00:26:20.744 --> 00:26:24.665
don't forget to subscribe, comment down
 below and check out how to be playlists.

